    <string name="onb_intro_body">Malbotdari is a chat assistant that runs entirely on this phone: no account, no internet. It answers questions, reads the files you point it to, proposes calendar events and contacts, and runs tasks later or when a matching file arrives. Nothing happens to your files or calendar without your OK.</string>
